{"id":"n37744-1-3","stage":1,"title":"깜짝 · 一惊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37744-1-3-1","ko":"어제 내 방에 갑자기 큰 새가 날아 들어온 거 있지!","zh":"昨天我房间里突然飞进了一只大鸟，对吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"방에","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방에","audio":"/audio/6744ad97e6c1288d41a3.mp3"}},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"새가","meaning":"鸟","explanation":"새：鸟；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30197","senseId":"1","lemma":"새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새가","audio":"/audio/accb80fce139c62a3082.mp3"}},{"text":"날아","meaning":"飞，飞行，飞翔","explanation":"날다：飞，飞行，飞翔；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"날다","audio":"/audio/76b67f83e82ca545fcf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61530","senseId":"1","lemma":"날다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날아","audio":"/audio/fb475f4dc714661db5fa.mp3"}},{"text":"들어온","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어온","audio":"/audio/5d5dd728f70348d8a023.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"있지!","meaning":"就是","explanation":"있다：就是；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"7","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있지","audio":"/audio/6af127780f763fcd960b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"e2d38c50201cf36d","term":"새","zh":"鸟","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3","entryId":"30197","definition":"身上长有羽毛和翅膀、能飞翔的两足动物。","pronunciation":["새ː"]},{"id":"76b67f83e82ca545","term":"날다","zh":"飞，飞行，飞翔","audio":"/audio/76b67f83e82ca545fcf6.mp3","entryId":"61530","definition":"在空中从某个位置移动到另一个位置。","pronunciation":["날다"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"就是","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"用于强调或确认某个对象或事实。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1c3a6325159385fbfea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37744-1-3-2","ko":"정말 깜짝 놀랐겠다.","zh":"你肯定被吓了一跳吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"깜짝","meaning":"一惊","explanation":"깜짝：一惊","readings":[{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37744","senseId":"1","lemma":"깜짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깜짝","audio":"/audio/b47d1db3113dea645dee.mp3"}},{"text":"놀랐겠다.","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio"